              "text" : "<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\"><br />Learning also extends beyond the classroom through field trips and signature Z Journeys. From outdoor experiences to visits to Philadelphia and Washington, D.C., students gain the confidence to navigate new environments.<br /><br />By eighth grade, students begin preparing directly for the transition ahead. They tour Zeta High, meet current students, visit classes, and register for the coming year.<br /><br />Students leave Zeta Middle School with advanced academic preparation, greater independence, real-world experience, and lasting relationships—ready to succeed in high school and shape what comes next.<br /><br /><strong>Families who choose Zeta Middle School have a school that partners with them all the way through high school.</strong>  Along the way, students will learn within a community that knows them deeply and grows with them.<br /><br />Come visit a Zeta school, <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>sign up for an upcoming event or tour</u></a> to learn more about our love-driven education. <br /><br /></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\">Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><em><br />Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. <br />✉️ <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</u></a><br />&#x1f4de; <a href=\"tel